{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"forEach","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"R","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"reading","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rTypes","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": repeat (each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"R","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":").Type, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"writing","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"wTypes","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": repeat (each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":").Type, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"body","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"inout","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"), repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"R","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rethrows","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"R","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Component","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12FirebladeECS9ComponentP","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component"},{"text":", repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Component","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12FirebladeECS9ComponentP","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is the fallback for more than 4 read or 4 written types; fewer are served by the overloads with fixed arity,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which are faster because their loop specializes. The contract is the one of those overloads (see"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the overload that reads 1 and writes 1 type), with two differences in shape:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" receives the written components first, as one ","type":"text"},{"code":"inout","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" tuple, then the read components. Swift can not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"express ","type":"text"},{"code":"inout","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" pack parameters in a closure, and two packs in one closure type can not be inferred.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The written components are copied out of the storage into the tuple and back after ","type":"text"},{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" returned, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"write is not visible in the storage before ","type":"text"},{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" returns.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"code":["family.forEach(reading: A.self, B.self, C.self, D.self, E.self, writing: X.self, Y.self) { (written: inout (X, Y), a, b, c, d, e) in","    written.0.value += a.value","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Specialization is disabled for this slow path: the Swift 6.4 SIL GenericSpecializer crashes on it in release builds"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TypeSubstituter.transformPackElementType"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]},{"name":"Complexity","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(N) where N is the number of members, plus one hash lookup per component type."}]}],"style":"note"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/family\/foreach(reading:writing:body:)"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Family\/forEach(reading:writing:body:)"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Family"]]},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","conformance":{"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"each C"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Component"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},"modules":[{"name":"FirebladeECS"}],"role":"symbol","title":"forEach(reading:writing:body:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"forEach"},{"kind":"text","text":"<each "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"R"},{"kind":"text","text":", each "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"reading"},{"kind":"text","text":": repeat (each "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"R"},{"kind":"text","text":").Type, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"writing"},{"kind":"text","text":": repeat (each "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":").Type, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"body"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"inout"},{"kind":"text","text":" (repeat each "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"W"},{"kind":"text","text":"), repeat each "},{"text":"R","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":